1
00:00:03,295 --> 00:00:04,671
Why am I here now?

2
00:00:04,796 --> 00:00:06,274
[Shindecent]
[Is shooting going well?]

3
00:00:06,298 --> 00:00:08,175
[Please call me]
I could just text him

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:08,967
[Don't bail me
and let's talk]

5
00:00:09,092 --> 00:00:11,428
[Shindecent]

6
00:00:13,931 --> 00:00:15,307
Take it

7
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:16,512
Seems like
an important call

8
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:22,606
Thank you
for the coffee truck

9
00:00:24,524 --> 00:00:25,692
I'm here to say this

10
00:00:29,404 --> 00:00:30,948
Did the shooting

11
00:00:31,073 --> 00:00:32,073
go well?

12
00:00:35,911 --> 00:00:37,204
I ruined it

13
00:00:37,329 --> 00:00:38,538
Don't worry

14
00:00:39,706 --> 00:00:40,999
You've always
done great…

15
00:00:45,462 --> 00:00:47,756
Are you gonna say
I don't know about you?

16
00:00:53,804 --> 00:00:55,555
I'm sorry about
what happened that day

17
00:00:56,974 --> 00:00:57,974
That's surprising

18
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:03,105
I didn't expect
your apology

19
00:01:05,524 --> 00:01:07,651
Physical affections
like that…

20
00:01:09,194 --> 00:01:10,612
Dating and breaking up…

21
00:01:13,907 --> 00:01:16,076
Isn't that nothing
for someone like you?

22
00:01:19,621 --> 00:01:20,621
Or…

23
00:01:23,125 --> 00:01:24,161
are you sorry

24
00:01:24,245 --> 00:01:26,336
for toying
with my feelings?

25
00:01:26,461 --> 00:01:27,629
Did I make you confused?

26
00:01:29,715 --> 00:01:32,342
I'm saying sorry for
showing my feelings

27
00:01:33,969 --> 00:01:35,971
not for toying
with yours

28
00:01:41,476 --> 00:01:42,476
Do you…

29
00:01:45,272 --> 00:01:46,272
like me?
